WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.533 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The Node.js lab reads three
synthetic Alpaca records.

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:14.600 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The search dialog finds
the troubleshooting guide.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.100 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The lab opens from
the site navigation.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.233 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The ZIP includes a script
and three sample records.

00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:24.033 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The Node.js example
prints 0 of 10 filled.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:31.067 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The tabs switch among
three states of one order.

00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:34.100 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
Three squares stay filled
when the order is canceled.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:40.200 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The JSON shows qty, status
and filled_qty.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.667 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The troubleshooting guide
opens on cancellation.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:47.733 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The reply asks for the ID
to check the actual order.

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:52.100 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The link opens the
read-only lookup by ID.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.233 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The second lookup accepts
the saved client_order_id.

00:00:56.233 --> 00:01:00.100 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The guide explains what
a 404 leaves unresolved.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.667 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The teaching article opens
on the three-page project.

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:11.133 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The article shows the
scaffold and seed files.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:20.133 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The instructions identify
the page and its heading.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:26.267 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
A tabs example sets up
the guide navigation.

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:30.067 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The helper prints the rank,
link and returned text.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:34.400 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The article explains the
move to Netlify.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:40.167 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The example site offers
page and section search.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:44.000 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The first section answers
the cancellation question.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.967 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The search field gets
a different question.

00:01:48.967 --> 00:01:51.267 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The first section names
the writer’s test steps.

00:01:51.267 --> 00:01:53.900 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The recorded learner result
appears below live search.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:58.333 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The example wrongly uses
the sample’s three fills.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:03.633 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The draft stays in the tab.

00:02:03.633 --> 00:02:11.667 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
Two canceled fixtures have
different fill counts.

00:02:11.667 --> 00:02:14.033 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The appendix compares
source with served copy.

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:19.367 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The appendix checks the
MCP response and the ZIP.

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:22.933 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The next exercise revises
the final fixture.

00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:26.433 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The command writes a
separate five-share copy.

00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:30.967 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The exercise compares
two copies of one record.

00:02:30.967 --> 00:02:34.567 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The same inspector reads
both local records.

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:39.000 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
Three shares filled before.
The revised sample has five.

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.933 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The sample count changes.
The lookup still applies.

00:02:43.933 --> 00:02:48.000 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The agent reference opens
on the public guide.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:50.833 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The page menu lists
View as Markdown.

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:55.000 line:76% position:50% size:91% align:center
The guide shows its
